msgstr "'n Algemene naam vir die Gasheertipe.  Byvoorbeeld, Windows 7"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The OS version for the Host Type"
msgstr "Die OS-weergawe vir die Gasheertipe"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "A unique set of characters from the snmp sysDescr that uniquely identify this device"
msgstr "'n Unieke stel karakters uit die SNMP sysDescr wat hierdie toestel uniek identifiseer"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The vendor specific snmp sysObjectID that distinguishes this device from the next"
msgstr "Die verskaffer-spesifieke snmp sysObjectID wat hierdie toestel van die volgende onderskei"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The primary key for this table is a combination of the following two fields:"
msgstr "Die primêre sleutel vir hierdie tabel is 'n kombinasie van die volgende twee velde:"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "Therefore, if you attempt to import duplicate device types, the existing data will be updated with the new information."
msgstr "Daarom, as u probeer om duplikaat-toesteltipes in te voer, sal die bestaande data met die nuwe inligting bygewerk word."

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The Host Type is determined by scanning its snmp agent for the sysObjectID and sysDescription and comparing it against values in the Host Types database.  The first match that is found in the database is used aggregate Host data.  Therefore, it is very important that you select valid sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch for your Hosts."
msgstr "Die Gasheertipe word bepaal deur sy SNMP-agent te skandeer vir die sysObjectID en sysDescription en dit te vergelyk met waardes in die Gasheertipes-databasis.  Die eerste ooreenkoms wat in die databasis gevind word, word gebruik om Gasheerdata saam te voeg.  Dit is dus baie belangrik dat jy geldige sysObjectID en sysDescrMatch vir jou Gashere kies."

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "Device Scanning Function Options"
msgstr "Opsies vir toestelskandeerfunksies"

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "Give this Host Type a meaningful name."
msgstr "Gee hierdie gasheertipe 'n betekenisvolle naam."

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "Fill in the name for the version of this Host Type."
msgstr "Vul die naam vir die weergawe van hierdie Gasheertipe in."

#: hmib_types.php
msgid "System Description Match"
